{"id":"ics-037","stemHtml":"<p>C 函数 <code>int less(float a, float b) { return a &lt; b; }</code> 的 <code>a</code>、<code>b</code> 分别放在 <code>%xmm0</code>、<code>%xmm1</code>。编译器生成的汇编是</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-text\">less:\n    comiss %xmm1, %xmm0\n    setb   %al\n    setnp  %dl\n    andb   %dl, %al\n    movzbl %al, %eax\n    ret</code></pre></p>\n<p>回答：</p>\n<p>（1）<code>comiss</code> 比较的是哪两个数？它设置哪些标志位？</p>\n<p>（2）为什么不能只用 <code>setb %al</code>（把中间两条去掉）？</p>\n<p>（3）当 <code>a</code> 为 NaN、<code>b = 1.0f</code> 时，CF、ZF、PF 各是什么？函数最终返回多少？</p>\n<p>（4）如果函数改成 <code>a &gt; b</code>，可以只用 <code>comiss %xmm1, %xmm0; seta %al</code>。为什么这里不需要再加 <code>setnp</code>？</p>\n<p>（5）如果要判断 <code>a == b</code>，应该怎样组合 <code>set</code> 指令？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<code>comiss</code> 按「<code>%xmm0</code> 减 <code>%xmm1</code>」设置 ZF、PF、CF 三个标志。对普通数，小于、等于、大于分别对应 CF、ZF 的不同组合；但只要有一个操作数是 NaN，结果就是「无序」，此时 ZF=PF=CF=1。浮点比较的坑全在无序这一种情况上。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p>（1）<code>comiss %xmm1, %xmm0</code> 比较 <code>%xmm0</code>（即 <code>a</code>）与 <code>%xmm1</code>（即 <code>b</code>），按 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a-b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span> 的结果设置 ZF、PF、CF：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&lt;b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span>：CF=1，ZF=0，PF=0；</li>\n<li><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span>：ZF=1，CF=0，PF=0；</li>\n<li><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span>：CF=0，ZF=0，PF=0；</li>\n<li>无序（任一为 NaN）：ZF=1，PF=1，CF=1。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>（2）<code>setb</code> 只检查 CF 是否为 1。对普通数，CF=1 确实等价于 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&lt;b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span>；但 NaN 参与比较时会进入无序状态，CF 也被置 1，于是 <code>setb</code> 会返回 1，而 C 语言规定 <code>NaN &lt; 1.0f</code> 为假。后面的 <code>setnp</code> 检查 PF=0（即「不是无序」），再与 <code>setb</code> 相与，才能排除 NaN。</p>\n<p>（3）<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>NaN</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=\\text{NaN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NaN</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=1.0f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span> 时是无序：ZF=1，PF=1，CF=1。<code>setb</code> 得 1，<code>setnp</code> 得 0，相与得 0，<code>movzbl</code> 扩展后返回 0。这正是 C 语义要求的「假」。</p>\n<p>（4）<code>seta</code> 的条件是「CF=0 且 ZF=0」。无序时 CF=1、ZF=1，条件自动不成立，返回 0；而真正 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&gt;b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span> 时 CF=0、ZF=0，返回 1。所以 <code>&gt;</code> 不需要额外的 PF 检查，<code>&lt;</code> 才需要。</p>\n<p>（5）<code>a == b</code> 要求 ZF=1 且不是无序，即 PF=0：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-text\">    comiss %xmm1, %xmm0\n    sete   %al\n    setnp  %dl\n    andb   %dl, %al</code></pre></p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是以为 <code>comiss</code> 只设置 ZF 和 CF，漏掉 PF，从而看不懂 <code>setnp</code> 为什么存在。二是把「无序」当成等于：无序时 ZF=1，若用 <code>sete</code> 判断相等而不加 <code>setnp</code>，会把 NaN 误判为等于某个数。三是把 <code>setb</code> 理解成「小于等于」——<code>setb</code> 是「低于」（CF=1），<code>setbe</code> 才是「低于或等于」。四是把 <code>comiss</code> 的操作数顺序记反：AT&amp;T 语法中 <code>comiss %xmm1, %xmm0</code> 是用 <code>%xmm0</code> 去比 <code>%xmm1</code>。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>（1）比较 <code>%xmm0</code> 中的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span> 与 <code>%xmm1</code> 中的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span>，按 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a-b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span> 设置 ZF、PF、CF；（2）NaN 时 CF=1，只用 <code>setb</code> 会错误地返回 1；（3）CF=ZF=PF=1，返回 0；（4）<code>seta</code> 要求 CF=0 且 ZF=0，无序时两者都是 1，自然为假；（5）<code>sete</code> 与 <code>setnp</code> 相与</p>\n"}